                "Polymerizer PZ-3 at Ppta-Slack PS-8 sits at 18.4 bar PPD dope, 3.6 bar shy of the "
                "22.0 bar rupture disc. A crown spotlight prints 24.6 bar on the shell pyrometer. "
                "Pressure-first should keep the 6.0 t/h PPD charge; spotlight-first would park a "
                "legal PPTA dope.",